/// Classification — the outcome of `Reconciler classify:`: refreshed issues
/// split by what the orchestrator should do with their workers.
///
/// - `terminal` — issue IDs in a terminal state (stop the worker and clean
///   up its workspace)
/// - `active` — IssueRefs still in an active state (update the tracked state)
/// - `dropped` — issue IDs neither terminal nor active (stop without cleanup)
typed Value subclass: Classification
  field: terminal :: List(String) = #()
  field: active :: List(IssueRef) = #()
  field: dropped :: List(String) = #()
